    "body": "<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-requirements\">\n<p>You must be the Portfolio Owner to close a portfolio.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JJVK0S53TKHRR2MAE838HCM1\">You will learn</h2>\n<p>Learn how to close a portfolio account in Klaviyo, which permanently deletes the portfolio and its metrics. Closing a portfolio unlinks all accounts, but has no other impact on any linked account. </p>\n<p>This article only includes instructions for portfolios. For information about closing a regular account, see <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/1260805595309\">how to cancel, close, or downgrade an account to free</a>. </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JJVK0S530Q9CXPMKHE8QBDDY\">Close a portfolio</h2>\n<p>Closing a portfolio deletes it and any data in that portfolio.</p>\n<p>Once deleted, you cannot recover the portfolio. Instead, you must recreate it by manually linking each account again and re-establishing the metrics. </p>\n<ol>\n<li>If you are the Portfolio Owner, click the account name in the bottom left. </li>\n<li>Select <strong>Settings &gt; Portfolio</strong>.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/33385335863067\" alt=\"Settings page, highlighting the Portfolio tab\" width=\"371\" height=\"295\">\n</li>\n<li>Scroll down to the <em>Close portfolio </em>section</li>\n<li>Select the <strong>Close portfolio </strong>button. <br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/33385335871515\">\n</li>\n<li>Choose the reason why you’re closing the portfolio: \n<ul>\n<li>Consolidating portfolios\n<ul>\n<li>We are consolidating portfoliose</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Issue with portfolio\n<ul>\n<li>Portfolio is difficult to use.</li>\n<li>Portfolio doesn't have the features or functionality I want.</li>\n<li>Portfolio has issues or bugs.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Other\n<ul>\n<li>Testing out portfolio</li>\n<li>No longer needed <em><br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/33385335873691\" alt=\"close portfolio reason.png\"><br></em>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Optional: tell us more about why you're closing, so Klaviyo can make improvements. </li>\n<li>Select <strong>Continue </strong>in the upper right. </li>\n<li>Export the following before continuing by clicking the <strong>Export CSV </strong>buttons: \n<ul>\n<li>Billing</li>\n<li>Metrics<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/33385368794523\">\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Select <strong>Continue </strong>in the upper right.</li>\n<li>Confirm the name of the portfolio (it is not case sensitive). <br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/33385335880859\" alt=\"confirm portfolio name before closing.png\">\n</li>\n<li>When you are ready to finish deleting this portfolio, select <strong>Close portfolio</strong>.\n<ul>\n<li>This action deletes all of the portfolio’s data. </li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Once you close a portfolio, you are logged out of Klaviyo. You need to sign back in to access another account. </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JJVK0S53AQCQ5NS07PFNWC03\">Additional resources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/24656917054747\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Getting started with portfolios</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/25185303538587\">How to change the Owner of a portfolio</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/1260805595309\">How to cancel, close, or downgrade an account to free</a></li>\n</ul>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
